          "mechanic": "Many noisy attribution bars regroup into four region blocks",
          "note": "Spectrum and attributions are ILLUSTRATIVE. CRIME: Zaki et al. 2025, ACS Sensors. GRASS: Yang et al. 2026, SAA 344:126394. No GradCAM/LIME comparison figures shown."
        }
