    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "VERDICT",
      "narration_text": "Here's the verdict. Three subsections, three different fixes. Compute was reframed as a recommendation with a cost. Interpretability was updated with real progress. And generalization was qualified: early cross-device work exists, but the hardest cases are still untested.",
      "new_visual_element": "Verdict card",
